      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Conklin sits on the south border of Broome County, abutting Pennsylvania and lying along the Susquehanna River near its confluence with the Chenango.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        26,
